anu \"Chapulin\" Chao","Manu \"Chapulín\" Chao","Manu CHAO","Manu Chan","Manu Chao (Mano Negra)","Manu Chao (Radio Bemba)","Manu Chao From Mano Negra","Manuachao","Manuchao","Manuel","Manuel Chao","Manuel José Chao","Manuel Tchao","Manú Chao"]},"schemaVersion":2,"sourceUrl":"https://www.discogs.com/artist/30773-Manu-Chao","type":"artist","urls":["https://www.manuchao.net","https://www.facebook.com/manuchao","https://myspace.com/manuchao","https://soundcloud.com/manuchao","https://twitter.com/manuchao","https://www.instagram.com/manuchaoofficial","https://www.youtube.com/@manuchao","https://www.tiktok.com/@manuchaoofficial","https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Manu_Chao"]}},"/api/discogs/artist/321/profile":{"cached":true,"profile":{"id":"321","image":"https://i.discogs.com/49dngttQCsjSiBSS3H4qj0MGYzWqGg2EyPOf_lCYT1E/rs:fit/g:sm/q:90/h:600/w:472/czM6Ly9kaXNjb2dz/LWRhdGFiYXNlLWlt/YWdlcy9BLTMyMS0x/NTQyOTc3MzEwLTgw/NTAuanBlZw.jpeg","imageThumb":"https://i.discogs.com/ajV9j7X0rMm4UUcFKaLOt-9qMl-DZmkyeK34ffk5W8k/rs:fit/g:sm/q:40/h:150/w:150/czM6Ly9kaXNjb2dz/LWRhdGFiYXNlLWlt/YWdlcy9BLTMyMS0x/NTQyOTc3MzEwLTgw/NTAuanBlZw.jpeg","profile":"British drum'n'bass DJ, producer/remixer.\n\nBorn: 20 September 1967 in London, England, UK.\n\nHis alias LTJ Bukem is from the popular Hawaii Five-O cop show catchphrase \"Book 'Em Danno\" as Williamson's name is almost like the main character 'Danny \"Danno\" Williams'. The 'LTJ' part is from his first manager who was Italian and used to call him \"el dj\" (Italian for \"the DJ\").\n\nHead of the [url=https://www.discogs.com/label/324968-Good-Looking-Records-Ltd]Good Looking Organisation[/url] of labels and artists. Widely acknowledged to be one of the leading figures in the genre of atmospheric or intelligent drum'n'bass.\n\nWilliamson started out playing house in the late 1980s and early 1990s, before setting up his [l=Good Looking Records] label and releasing seminal jungle tracks like \"[url=https://www.discogs.com/LTJ-Bukem-Demons-Theme-A-Couple-Of-Beats/master/25637]Demon's Theme[/url]\" (1992) and \"[url=https://www.discogs.com/LTJ-Bukem-Music-Happy-Raw-Enchanted/master/50130]Music[/url]\" (1993), as well as the popular \"[l=Logical Progression]\" series of compilations, amongst many other releases.\n\nWas resident DJ of well-known drum'n'bass club night \"Speed\" in London, he's still producing and touring the world today.","provider":"discogs","ref":"discogs:artist:321","relations":{"aliases":[{"id":272468,"name":"The Bookworm"},{"id":577300,"name":"Daniel Williamson"}],"groups":null,"members":null,"namevariations":["Bukem","DJ LTJ Bukem","DJ-LTJ Bukem","L. T. J. Bukem","L.T. Bukem","L.T. J Bukem","L.T.J Bukem","L.T.J.","L.T.J. Bukem","LJJ Bukem","LTJ","LTJ-Bukem","LYJ Bukem"]},"schemaVersion":2,"sourceUrl":"https://www.discogs.com/artist/321-LTJ-Bukem","type":"artist","urls":["https://www.facebook.com/LTJBukem","https://twitter.com/therealLTJbukem","https://soundcloud.com/ltj-bukem","https://www.mixcloud.com/LTJBukem","https://www.instagram.com/ltj_bukem","https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/LTJ_Bukem"]}},"/api/discogs/artist/38863/profile":{"cached":true,"profile":{"id":"38863","image":"https://i.discogs.com/skfOuVLaEBQBCqzflLQOXygt6XvHiKA8pYdSWKGUUbc/rs:fit/g:sm/q:90/h:600/w:600/czM6Ly9kaXNjb2dz/LWRhdGFiYXNlLWlt/YWdlcy9BLTM4ODYz/LTE2NDk1MTkyNjQt/MTA3OC5qcGVn.jpeg","imageThumb":"https://i.discogs.com/Lb6udytRqfBurOlDwW_4hAajOYRsQWw5Q7PKDIF_eB8/rs:fit/g:sm/q:40/h:150/w:150/czM6Ly9kaXNjb2dz/LWRhdGFiYXNlLWlt/YWdlcy9BLTM4ODYz/LTE2NDk1MTkyNjQt/MTA3OC5qcGVn.jpeg","profile":"American singer, pianist, and songwriter.\r\n\r\nBorn: 25 March 1942 in Memphis, Tennessee, USA.\r\nDied: 16 August 2018 in Detroit, Michigan, USA (age 76).\r\n\r\nWidely regarded as one of the best female vocalists of all time, she is nicknamed the 'Queen of Soul' or simply referred to as 'Aretha'. In 1987 she was the first woman to be inducted into the Rock & Roll Hall of Fame (Performer).\r\n\r\nDaughter of [a=Reverend C.L. Franklin] 